{"ticker":{"symbol":"PVLA","name":"Palvella Therapeutics, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":175.92,"change_pct":0.1215811284666879,"market_cap":2571678976.0,"pe":-21.479855,"pb":77.840706,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":72.225,"week52_high":176.94,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"United States","city":"Wayne","employees":29,"website":"https://palvellatx.com","business_summary":"Palvella Therapeutics, Inc., a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company, focuses on developing and commercializing novel therapies to treat patients serious and rare genetic skin diseases. The company's lead product candidate is QTORIN rapamycin, a novel, 3.9% anhydrous topical gel that is in Phase 3 clinical trial for the treatment of microcystic lymphatic malformations, as well as in Phase 2 clinical trial to treat cutaneous venous malformations. It also develops QTORIN rapamycin for the treatment of angiokeratomas and other mTOR-driven skin diseases; and QTORIN pitavastatin for the treatment of disseminated superficial actinic porokeratosis. The company is based in Wayne, Pennsylvania.","business_summary_ko":"임상 단계의 바이오제약 회사인 Palvella Therapeutics, Inc.는 심각한 희귀 유전성 피부 질환 환자를 치료하기 위한 새로운 치료법을 개발하고 상용화하는 데 중점을 두고 있습니다. 회사의 주요 제품 후보는 소낭성 림프 기형 치료를 위한 3상 임상 시험과 피부 정맥 기형 치료를 위한 2상 임상 시험이 진행 중인 새로운 3.9% 무수 국소 젤인 QTORIN 라파마이신입니다. 또한 혈관각화종 및 기타 mTOR 유발 피부질환 치료를 위한 QTORIN 라파마이신을 개발합니다. 파종성 표재 광선각화증 치료를 위한 QTORIN 피타바스타틴. 이 회사는 펜실베이니아주 웨인에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":0.0,"n":15,"eps":-6.38692,"eps_lo":-7.84,"eps_hi":-3.95,"eps_g":-0.72150004},{"period":"2027","rev":24630710.0,"rev_lo":6500000.0,"rev_hi":71100000.0,"rev_g":0.0,"n":14,"eps":-7.90636,"eps_lo":-13.52,"eps_hi":-1.54,"eps_g":-0.2379}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":0.0,"operating_income":-18040000.0,"net_income":-27552000.0,"eps":-2.455329},{"period":"2023","